    "text": "kotsam.com\nwebsite\nDeming\nCram the Cruiser Event to Support Local Youth\nBy John Krehbiel,\n3 hours agoDEMING – The Deming Police Department and Deming Public Schools are joining forces once again for a community-driven coat collection effort called Cram the Cruiser. The event will take place on Wednesday, October 30, 2025, from 3:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. in the Walmart parking lot. Shoppers are encouraged to stop by, look for the flashing police lights and the department’s banner, and donate new or gently used jackets for local children in need.\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nGreg Wilson, CFA\n·\nuser · 19.6K followers\n8 Foods You Can Eat A Lot Of Without Gaining Weight, According to a Dietitian\nKim Yawitz, RD, is a registered dietitian and gym owner in St. Louis, Mo. In addition to coaching fitness and nutrition clients one-on-one and in small groups, Kim also shares her expertise with national media outlets. She enjoys cooking, reading, and spending time with her family.\nSt. Louis, MO ·21d\nDianna Carney\n·\nuser · 35.7K followers",
